    },
    {
      "key": "t203e91fcb9bdf7fe",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Loss From a 1% Adverse Move</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">1% 不利走势带来的损失</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t07a9c291560bd92f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Margin Call?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是追加保证金通知？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td7102d73dd8f91eb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">margin call meaning</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> is a warning or account condition reached when equity falls to a set percentage of used margin. The account then has limited capacity to support open trades.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">追加保证金通知的含义</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">是，当净值降至已用保证金的规定百分比时，出现的一项警告或账户状态。此时账户支持未平仓交易的能力受到限制。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "teba8a07a03ebfd70",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">In the worked example, equity of $500 against $1,000 of used margin creates a 50% margin level. If equity fell to $300 while used margin remained $1,000, the margin level would be 30%, ignoring changes caused by partial liquidation, costs, or broker calculations.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在工作示例中，500 美元的净值与 1,000 美元的已用保证金形成 50% 的保证金水平。如果净值跌至 300 美元，而已用保证金仍为 1,000 美元，则保证金水平将为 30%，忽略部分清算、成本或经纪商计算引起的变化。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t16505bf263f4fa8a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is Margin Level, and How Is It Calculated?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是保证金水平以及如何计算？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4761a1e27c9101f4",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Margin level meaning:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> The percentage relationship between current account equity and the margin being used by open positions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">保证金水平的含义：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">账户当前净值与未平仓头寸已用保证金之间的百分比关系。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t11014367d02ed627",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Margin level is calculated as:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">保证金水平计算如下：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tcb8c616a8edb6176",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Used margin:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> $500</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">已用保证金：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> 500 美元</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7c2f90c631832bfe",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">If open losses reduce equity to $1,000:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">如果未平仓亏损将净值减少至 1,000 美元：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbe2c97a519484e2f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Margin level:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> $1,000 ÷ $500 × 100 = </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">200%</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">保证金水平：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> 1,000 美元 ÷ 500 美元 × 100 = </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">200%</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td5ab4f333e789e27",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The platform tracks balance, equity, used margin, free margin, margin level, margin-call level, and stop-out level as separate account properties.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">平台将余额、净值、已用保证金、可用保证金、保证金水平、追加保证金水平和强制平仓水平作为单独的账户属性进行跟踪。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t801ca8e3191422b1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How to Manage Leverage and Margin Responsibly</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">如何负责任地管理杠杆和保证金</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1e28b3f77b51430f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Leverage management begins with position size, not with choosing the highest ratio available.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">杠杆管理从头寸规模开始，而不是选择可用的最高比率。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t89572c453126ca9f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Size the position from the risk limit and stop distance.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">根据风险限额和止损距离确定仓位大小。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tec8515293ff22917",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Monitor exposure across correlated trades.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">监控相关交易的风险敞口。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ted9a5db124eb1a4b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Keep free margin for volatility and costs.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">保留可用保证金以应对波动性和成本。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbc66eedf971ad7b3",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Review margin level before adding positions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在添加头寸之前查看保证金水平。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbac333805266f578",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Is Leverage Trading Halal?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">杠杆交易清真吗？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t63fe2d472ce201ef",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Whether the instrument is a CFD or another derivative</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">该工具是差价合约还是其他衍生品</span>"
    }
  ]
